{"title": "Devilfoil Mask", "pageid": 3591, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Devilfoil_Mask", "categories": ["Helmets", "Common items", "Modify Ability Score set", "Strength set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Devilfoil_Mask_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Devilfoil_Mask_Icon.png/300px-Devilfoil_Mask_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/8/83/Devilfoil_Mask_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Devilfoil Mask image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Devilfoil_Mask_Icon.png/300px-Devilfoil_Mask_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Devilfoil_Mask_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Devilfoil Mask</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmet</a> worn by <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregons</a> that increases the wearer's <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> by 1 and decreases the wearer's <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> by 1 per nearby mask.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Beneath a layer of dust, the mask still gleams. An innocent smile and wide, searching eyes - seeking its own kind.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 50 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  50  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_UND_MerregonMask_001</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_MerregonMask_001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_MerregonMask_001\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b2409a86-dc0d-4193-9985-4f11419c64be</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b2409a86-dc0d-4193-9985-4f11419c64be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b2409a86-dc0d-4193-9985-4f11419c64be\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_MerregonMask</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_MerregonMask+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_MerregonMask+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Headwear_Merregon_Mask</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion\" title=\"Infernal Legion\">Infernal Legion</a></dt><dd>Grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/27px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/41px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/27px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\">Infernal Legion</a> condition while worn.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Infernal_Legion\"> Condition: Infernal Legion </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\">Infernal Legion</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>You are one, you are legion, without personality or individuality - born only to fight.</li>\n<li>When within 20 m (67 ft) of another creature wearing a merregon's mask, <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> increases by 1 and <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> decrease by 1 per nearby mask.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-620&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;325</span>: On a table near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrinn\" title=\"Thrinn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png/25px-Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png/38px-Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png/50px-Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sergeant Thrinn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png/25px-Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Elenna_Thrinn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrinn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrinn\">Sergeant Thrinn</a>, at the Dig Site</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-666&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;464</span>: On the ground at the foot of a staircase by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skarjall\" title=\"Skarjall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Portrait_Skarjall.png/25px-Portrait_Skarjall.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Portrait_Skarjall.png/38px-Portrait_Skarjall.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Portrait_Skarjall.png/50px-Portrait_Skarjall.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Skarjall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Portrait_Skarjall.png/25px-Portrait_Skarjall.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Portrait_Skarjall.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Skarjall\" title=\"Skarjall\">Skarjall</a>, behind a wall of rubble</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-574&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;380</span>: On an altar guarded by a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/25px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/38px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/50px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Merregon Legionnaire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/25px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Hellsboar\" title=\"Hellsboar\">Hellsboars</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-574&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;380</span>: Carried by the <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When first picked up, the character doing so can pass a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Arcana Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Arcana\" title=\"Arcana\">Arcana</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to identify it as a mask for a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/25px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/38px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/50px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Merregon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/25px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon</a>.</li>\n<li>As four of these masks are available relatively early in the game, they can, if worn by all party members, be used to raise the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/30px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/40px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> of those wearing them by 3.</li>\n<li>Devilfoil Masks can be crafted into <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orthon_Explosive\" title=\"Orthon Explosive\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/GRN_Orthonic_Handbomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orthon_Explosive\" title=\"Orthon Explosive\">Orthon Explosives</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/38px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/50px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dammon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a> while at the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>.</li>\n<li>These masks work well in conjunction with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler\" title=\"Tavern Brawler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/20px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/30px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/40px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tavern Brawler\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/20px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler\" title=\"Tavern Brawler\">Tavern Brawler</a> feat.</li>\n<li>During the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar#Self-Same_Trial\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Self-Same Trial</a>, any party members wearing the Devilfoil Mask will have their clone wearing a mask as well. These masks will stack with the party's masks as well as their own, causing every party member <i>and</i> their copy to receive the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\">Infernal Legion</a> buff. In this case, the buff can increase Strength by as much as 7, and decrease Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma by the same amount.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Infernal Legion:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\">Infernal Legion</a> condition is only applied if the mask's wearer is within range other creatures wearing a mask. It gains one stack for each mask within range, not including the wearer themself. It is also not displayed on the mask's tooltip in-game.</li>\n<li>Infernal Legion grants an uncapped bonus to Strength, but <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Priority\" title=\"Abilities\">takes effect before</a> other items and bonuses which raise Strength to a capped amount.</li>\n<li>Sometimes, upon a character level up, the Infernal Legion buff disappears; this can be corrected by unequipping and re-equipping the mask.</li>\n<li>The Infernal Legion buff disappears if a Druid wearing the mask uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Devilfoil_Mask_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Devilfoil_Mask_ingame.png/450px-Devilfoil_Mask_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/5/51/Devilfoil_Mask_ingame.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Devilfoil_Mask_ingame.png/450px-Devilfoil_Mask_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Devilfoil_Mask_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200605\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.109 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.116 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 